<view class="detail-page">
  <view class="tech-grid"></view><view class="detail-orb orb-one"></view><view class="detail-orb orb-two"></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="detail-error"><view>这份探索暂时未能打开</view><text>{{error}}</text><button bindtap="goToHome">返回探索页</button></view>
  <view wx:else class="detail-shell">
    <view class="protocol-line"><text class="protocol-dot"></text> PERSONALITY TREE <text>给自己一点时间</text></view>
    <view class="hero-panel">
      <view class="hero-scan"></view>
      <view class="icon-orbit"><view class="orbit-ring ring-one"></view><view class="orbit-ring ring-two"></view><view class="test-icon">{{test.icon}}</view><view class="orbit-node node-one"></view><view class="orbit-node node-two"></view></view>
      <view class="test-label">一份认识自己的小小开始</view>
      <view class="test-name">{{test.displayName || test.name}}</view>
      <view class="test-description">{{test.description}}</view>
      <view class="meta-grid"><view><text>{{test.questionsCount}}</text><text>道自我观察</text></view><view><text>{{test.time}}</text><text>预计耗时</text></view><view><text>∞</text><text>可反复探索</text></view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="guide-panel">
      <view class="guide-title"><text>把这段时间，留给自己</text><text>温柔的小提示</text></view>
      <view class="guide-item"><text>01</text><view><view>找到相对安静的环境</view><view>给直觉一点完整空间</view></view></view>
      <view class="guide-item"><text>02</text><view><view>依据最近真实状态回答</view><view>不需要选择“更好”的答案</view></view></view>
      <view class="guide-item"><text>03</text><view><view>完成后生成专属画像</view><view>本次记录会成为人格树的新年轮</view></view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="start-button" bindtap="startTest" hover-class="start-button-pressed"><view class="start-signal">✦</view><view><text>开始本次探索</text><text>给人格树添一片新叶</text></view><text class="start-arrow">→</text></view>
    <view class="safety-line"><text></text> 默认仅在本机保存 · 测评不作心理诊断</view>
  </view>
</view>
